[00:01.89]Coming and going are feelings that
[00:08.79]Lie deeply,but we can't rewind the time.
[00:16.89]Reminiscing about when I last saw your face
[00:26.93]Filled with laughter...
[00:31.34]Suddenly,you left without a way for me to say goodbye.
[00:39.02]How could you be so unfair and leave me behind?
[00:47.34]What am I to do now?
[00:50.87]I am here,all by myself.
[00:54.34]And now I feel the emptiness,realizing...
[01:03.67]When you once were there, so close to me...
[01:10.37]Took for granted every time you had been here.
[01:22.85]But,giving little thought unknowingly.
[01:26.82]Now,no longer,will I get to hear the sound of your voice.
[01:52.47]Over and over,it plays just like
[01:59.43]A broken cassette tape I can't discard...
[02:08.12]And it tangles tiself.At some point,it's too late.
[02:16.75]Left with anger.
[02:21.03]Overwhelemd by all the words I couldn't seem to say aloud and.
[02:29.02]Whild filled with what-if's,becomes just self-consuming.
[02:37.20]Even though that day was
[02:40.69]But a distant memory.
[02:43.56]Feels like it just happened yesterday.
[02:49.55]But,I know now...
[02:53.55]Even when I face the world each night,
[02:59.87]Left pretending,still pretending,but it's not right...
[03:09.05]But the truth is hard for me to take.
[03:15.08]That I'll only get to see you in my faded memories.
[04:00.44]Can you hear me there,up in the sky
[04:07.02]Looking down at all the world with no way to cry?
[04:15.10]Can there feelings reach you when I sink
[04:21.86]Into sorrow,far away from who I once was?
[04:30.68]I know if you could,you would have stayed
[04:36.69]Here beside me,never leaving,if you had a choice.
[04:44.80]I know that I should keep going on
[04:51.68]With your memory here inside me.Let my voice please reach you.
[05:05.49]Sorry for all from before.
[05:11.17]Thank you for the memories and all that you've done.
[05:18.86]Now wish I could show you at last
[05:25.96]That since then I've found my way back...but I'll miss you.
